out god "\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch scratches Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice hits the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice misses the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slice hits the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes Decimus.\n\rDecimus is stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch injures Decimus.\n\rDecimus is DEAD!!\n\rYou hear Decimus's death cry.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out dec "\n\rYou parry the goblin's attack.\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has some small wounds and bruises. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has some small wounds and bruises. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice hits the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is poisoned by the venom on a small sword.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the goblin's attack.\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<21hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch scratches you.\n\rYour slice hits the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<18hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rYour slice misses the goblin.\n\rThe goblin looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<10hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rYou sure are BLEEDING!\n\rYour slice grazes the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<5hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch misses you.\n\rYour slice hits the goblin.\n\rA small sword draws life from the goblin.\n\rThe goblin is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<5hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe goblin's punch grazes you.\n\rYou are stunned, but will probably recover.\n\r\n\r<0hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou have been KILLED!!\n\r\n\r\n\r<1hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
